{"time": 1763305611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2065307240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“你们和不友善的部落关系好吗”"}
