{"time": 1763305646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1306521286", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=411724224][CQ:at,qq=2422497068] 有地图吗？"}
