{"time": 1763305683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1667871020", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这地方我可怎么上去，后面还有伤员。\""}
{"time": 1763305701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1158686960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“那我们要不杀一条路出来吧”"}
{"time": 1763305703, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415687944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1306521286]无，洞穴之间有巨大的裂痕，无法绕过去"}
{"time": 1763305712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "336130287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“你们有变巨术吗？”"}
{"time": 1763305728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "386374395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“峡谷外很近就能到你们部落吗？”"}
{"time": 1763305746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261172107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“先过去几个人试试喊人过来帮忙？”"}
