{"time": 1763305810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1563627363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“不过似乎也没法保证前面会不会还有地质变动？……”"}
{"time": 1763305821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723899907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“这个距离我可以轻松跳过去”"}
