{"time": 1763306355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "89457604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "兰恩“谢天谢地，这些地上人把咳孢子草干掉了”"}
