{"time": 1763306419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1127113108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "你好邪恶"}
{"time": 1763306425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1288228364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "圣武士不说些什么吗"}
{"time": 1763306448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1419384653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "穿着一件精制品链甲衫。一具尸体上还带着一瓶治疗轻伤药水，另外一具尸体包里带着惊恐术卷轴。两具尸体总共可以搜出129gp"}
{"time": 1763306449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237335515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "（不能让死者身上的非自然产物污染大自然（¥"}
{"time": 1763306501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614584304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "但是，哪怕你是文盲，你也知道，艾奥梅黛的圣教军都是拿长剑和盾牌的"}
{"time": 1763306511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "27968846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "但是这两句尸体的武器却是"}
{"time": 1763306512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "933260962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "大砍刀！"}
{"time": 1763306533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631312668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1763306536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "305691804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“大砍刀？我记得巴弗灭的偏好武器是这个”"}
{"time": 1763306541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1527023721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“圣教军怎么会用这个武器？”"}
{"time": 1763306544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "753333243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "还有，带着卷轴的尸体拳头里紧紧抓着一样东西——一个黄铜牛头徽章，眼睛是红宝石。"}
{"time": 1763306551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203767844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“呜啊，这是什么勇者神的恶趣味吗”"}
{"time": 1763306551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248060566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=305691804][CQ:at,qq=1009793416] 你好有宗教水平啊"}
{"time": 1763306562, "type": "recv", "message_id": "930533689", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=753333243]过个知识宗教"}
{"time": 1763306569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984064793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "可以认出来这玩意儿是谁的徽记"}
{"time": 1763306572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "41432228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": ".rd+4"}
{"time": 1763306572, "type": "reply", "message_id": "41432228", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[灵风雨璇]演奏出: 1D20+4={11}+4=15"}
{"time": 1763306576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593744740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "可以"}
{"time": 1763306578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "822640042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "果不其然"}
{"time": 1763306584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1240756677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "这玩意儿就是巴弗灭的徽记！"}
{"time": 1763306593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275265835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "那么， 这两句尸体的身份已经很明显了"}
{"time": 1763306618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1031622537", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "安妮维亚“居然是巴弗灭的邪教徒扮演的圣教军，真是畜生！”"}
{"time": 1763306658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "503090728", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "霍尔格斯“呵呵，依我所见，明明是你们圣教军的一份子看到了真实的恶魔，被吓破了胆，堕落了”"}
{"time": 1763306672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "906226114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“住嘴 ！不许诋毁圣教军！”"}
{"time": 1763306684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693364955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“你见过真实的恶魔吗”"}
{"time": 1763306691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133137538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "安妮维亚和霍尔格斯发生了争执"}
{"time": 1763306701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1550687952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（你妈的，那我问你，谁砍的银龙）"}
{"time": 1763306720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1378185448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "听不懂，先把精制链甲衫换上"}
{"time": 1763306728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "883438114", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（你的素质很差）"}
{"time": 1763306733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "220076914", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "（你的素质很差）"}
{"time": 1763306765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459090082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "兰恩“这种打扮的人，最近已经在地下出现了一段时间了”"}
{"time": 1763306772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338797614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "“自然即是优胜劣汰啊，呵呵。”"}
{"time": 1763306775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1044318776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“他们还和一个和我们敌对的部落结盟了”"}
{"time": 1763306794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868329417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“如果这种人是你们的敌人的话，，，那可能地下的情形不是特别好”"}
{"time": 1763306830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "544034836", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（你们还有什么要说的吗，没有的话，就接着走了？）"}
{"time": 1763306880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "281252651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“啧巴弗灭的信徒真是狡猾”"}
{"time": 1763306894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1139839244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“不过你见过拿长剑的这种打扮的人吗？”"}
{"time": 1763306902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2027928841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“没印象了”"}
{"time": 1763306934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1157493517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“也不知道是怎么搞的，为什么圣教军对地下的管理这么差劲啊”"}
{"time": 1763306956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "789199242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“这里的几条路都是通往哪里的？”"}
{"time": 1763306976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "321098450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "：“有些是其他的部落”"}
{"time": 1763306982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172614706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“有些是绝路”"}
{"time": 1763306990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759576154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“而这一条是通往我们的部落的”"}
{"time": 1763307043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974491006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“好，那我们继续前进吧”"}
{"time": 1763307112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "822612598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "那你们开始向北方进发大约1100尺"}
{"time": 1763307138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1642459259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "终于到达一个直径20尺的圆形大洞穴。四个混种人守卫着一个大石门。"}
{"time": 1763307146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506935609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "兰恩“嘿，是我！ 我们回来了”"}
{"time": 1763307305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691152095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "总之，在你们抵达混种人部落之后，没过多久"}
{"time": 1763307314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "386941013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "你们就见到了这个部落的酋长"}
{"time": 1763307323, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1833631395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=E61921F87A513B4A0DF152E07E21F5B9.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSTh3nkO0e9RXd2bZg1pKaRY1_WixjcgCUg_woopYXZ1P_2kAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQLYKS-UKZPSdWbn4Hm5cGmXoC5TWCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAISMDa6if2UIsNfCGE4DHG_HzY4l95lfPdyJ81FSZtce-6SzBTGk3g0uqTWIYIIoguZNQ,file_size=606300]"}
{"time": 1763307368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1667251921", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "兰恩和酋长汇报了遇到你们的情况"}
{"time": 1763307421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "595488379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "酋长先是感谢了你们的帮助。随后他询问道“你们为什么会出现在洞穴里“”"}
{"time": 1763307437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280983329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "（人呢）"}
{"time": 1763307448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1009255320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“地面上发生了变故，有恶魔攻入了城内，我们掉进裂开的大地里面”"}
{"time": 1763307455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "455975099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "1009793416"}, "sender": {"id": "1009793416", "name": "灵风雨璇"}, "message": "“请问有什么办法可以回到地上吗？”"}
{"time": 1763307456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "374838539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“对”"}
{"time": 1763307464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "878727364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "酋长的表情专注了起来"}
{"time": 1763307471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072759003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“什么，恶魔打进来了？”"}
{"time": 1763307478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "401954944", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"确实呢\""}
{"time": 1763307480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2098277440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=374838539]（你rp 的什么东西）"}
{"time": 1763307495, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1739248628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "（有什么问题？）"}
{"time": 1763307509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1839196925", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“虽然说我和我的子民在你们这种地上人看来只是弃民或怪物，不过怎么说我们的祖先也曾参加第一次圣战赶跑了恶魔”"}
{"time": 1763307541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1947174939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“既然圣战还没有结束，那我们这些最初的圣教军的后裔，也不能坐视不管”"}
{"time": 1763307557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363046035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "维兹"}, "message": "*肃然起敬"}
{"time": 1763307572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "146728481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2422497068"}, "sender": {"id": "2422497068", "name": "芊"}, "message": "“回到地面最近的一条路在这里的南边，不过这条路的出口被另一个不赞同尼斯霍姆的部落占领着”"}
{"time": 1763307585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005246841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "261292323", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "“有见血的必要吗”"}
